      "writtenOn": "2022-11-03T19:27:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think it makes a difference for the client though. Once we introduce this limit, the client code has to handle batching anyways. I\u0027m also not sure how feasible it is to have a blanket requirement of 20. If we could do that, I think it\u0027d be better to go with the first revision of this patch.",
      "parentUuid": "b2437ea8_f1a6d773",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 88,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 88,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "1aade0249054dc09a3a9ceefb16dfd1b3e90535d",
