      },
      "lineNbr": 88,
      "author": {
        "id": 1115498
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-03T20:33:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The client code already performs batching in groups of 20 today with v1/v2 implementations: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:packages/apps/RemoteProvisioner/src/com/android/remoteprovisioner/PeriodicProvisioner.java;l\u003d165-183\n\nMy other reason for wanting to split out v3+ from v1 and v2 is just so that we can at least aim to push the minimum envelop higher over time, even though some level of batching will be required to maintain simplicity.",
      "parentUuid": "88add7ff_7f85f0b0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 88,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 88,
        "endChar": 44
      },
      "revId": "1aade0249054dc09a3a9ceefb16dfd1b3e90535d",
