      "writtenOn": "2022-11-03T21:22:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That does makes sense. My concern is that we can\u0027t support this requirement on pixels yet. With KM rust coming in, we are in a state where we need to support 2 implementations right now. While that\u0027s the case, I\u0027d like to avoid pushing requirements that force changing HAL\u003c-\u003eTA and TA\u003c-\u003eTA ipc.",
